# Free Myself rules

- Treat `src/harness` as the execution spine for workbench features.
- Prefer deterministic tools for apply/verify; models only for NL understanding when present.
- After each feature: run `npm test` before committing.
- Do not edit the plan file in `.cursor/plans`.
- Document formatting must go through Format Spec + verifier, not opaque beautify templates.
- Keep Chinese UI copy concise; brand name is **Free Myself**.
